{"seq":1,"slug":"mvc-to-mvvm","title":"从 MVC 到 MVVM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-architecture/architecture-patterns/mvc-to-mvvm","wordCount":774,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"从-mvc-到-mvvm\">从 MVC 到 MVVM</h1><p>iOS 开发最经典的架构演进路线就是从 Apple MVC 走向 MVVM。本文将深入分析 MVC 的痛点，以及 MVVM 如何通过数据绑定和 Combine 框架解决这些问题。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>MVC 与 MVVM 都围绕 <strong>Model（数据）</strong>、<strong>View（展示）</strong> 与 <strong>Controller/ViewModel（协调层）</strong> 三层来组织代码，区别在于协调层的职责边界与视图同步方式。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Model</strong>：纯数据与业务模型，不依赖任何 UI 框架</li>\n<li><strong>View</strong>：只负责展示与用户交互</li>\n<li><strong>Controller（MVC）</strong>：同时承担生命周期、数据转换、网络与路由，职责向一处聚集</li>\n<li><strong>ViewModel（MVVM）</strong>：承接表现逻辑，暴露可观察属性供视图绑定</li>\n</ul>\n<p>二者最关键的分野是<strong>数据同步机制</strong>：MVC 依赖手动赋值，MVVM 借助 Combine 的 <code>@Published</code> 与 <code>ObservableObject</code> 做响应式绑定，视图随状态自动刷新。因为 ViewModel 是纯 Swift 对象、不依赖 UIKit，它可以脱离 UI 独立测试——这正是 MVVM 相对 MVC 的核心收益。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"apple-mvc-的问题\">Apple MVC 的问题</h2><p>Apple 官方推荐的 MVC（Model-View-Controller）在实际项目中往往演变为 <strong>Massive View Controller</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  Model --&gt; Controller&#10;  Controller --&gt; View&#10;  View --&gt; Controller&#10;  Controller --&gt; Model&#10;&#10;  classDef model fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50&#10;  classDef view fill:none,stroke:#2196F3&#10;  classDef ctrl fill:none,stroke:#FF9800&#10;&#10;  class Model model&#10;  class View view&#10;  class Controller ctrl\">graph LR\n  Model --&gt; Controller\n  Controller --&gt; View\n  View --&gt; Controller\n  Controller --&gt; Model\n\n  classDef model fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50\n  classDef view fill:none,stroke:#2196F3\n  classDef ctrl fill:none,stroke:#FF9800\n\n  class Model model\n  class View view\n  class Controller ctrl</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>职责膨胀</td>\n<td>UIViewController 同时承担视图生命周期、数据转换、网络请求、路由等职责</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试困难</td>\n<td>业务逻辑与 UIKit 耦合，需要实例化完整视图层才能测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复用性差</td>\n<td>Controller 中的逻辑无法跨界面复用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行开发受限</td>\n<td>多人同时修改同一个 Controller 极易冲突</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 如果你的 ViewController 超过 300 行，大概率已经出现了职责膨胀的信号。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"mvvm-架构概览\">MVVM 架构概览</h2><p>MVVM（Model-View-ViewModel）将表现逻辑从 Controller 中抽离到 ViewModel，通过数据绑定实现视图与状态的同步。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  View[&quot;View / ViewController&quot;] --&gt;|用户操作| ViewModel&#10;  ViewModel --&gt;|数据绑定| View&#10;  ViewModel --&gt; Model&#10;  Model --&gt; ViewModel&#10;&#10;  classDef vm fill:none,stroke:#9C27B0&#10;  classDef view fill:none,stroke:#2196F3&#10;  classDef model fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50&#10;&#10;  class View view&#10;  class ViewModel vm&#10;  class Model model\">graph LR\n  View[\"View / ViewController\"] --&gt;|用户操作| ViewModel\n  ViewModel --&gt;|数据绑定| View\n  ViewModel --&gt; Model\n  Model --&gt; ViewModel\n\n  classDef vm fill:none,stroke:#9C27B0\n  classDef view fill:none,stroke:#2196F3\n  classDef model fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50\n\n  class View view\n  class ViewModel vm\n  class Model model</pre><p>MVVM 的核心原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>View</strong> 只负责展示和用户交互</li>\n<li><strong>ViewModel</strong> 持有状态、处理业务逻辑、暴露可观察属性</li>\n<li><strong>Model</strong> 为纯数据层，不依赖任何 UI 框架</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"基于-combine-的-mvvm-实现\">基于 Combine 的 MVVM 实现</h2><p>Swift Combine 框架为 MVVM 的数据绑定提供了原生支持。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"import Combine&#10;import Foundation&#10;&#10;struct User {&#10;    let id: UUID&#10;    var name: String&#10;    var email: String&#10;}&#10;&#10;protocol UserServiceProtocol {&#10;    func fetchUser(id: UUID) -&gt; AnyPublisher&lt;User, Error&gt;&#10;}&#10;&#10;final class ProfileViewModel: ObservableObject {&#10;    @Published var userName: String = &quot;&quot;&#10;    @Published var userEmail: String = &quot;&quot;&#10;    @Published var isLoading: Bool = false&#10;    @Published var errorMessage: String?&#10;&#10;    private let userService: UserServiceProtocol&#10;    private var cancellables = Set&lt;AnyCancellable&gt;()&#10;&#10;    init(userService: UserServiceProtocol) {&#10;        self.userService = userService&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func loadUser(id: UUID) {&#10;        isLoading = true&#10;        errorMessage = nil&#10;&#10;        userService.fetchUser(id: id)&#10;            .receive(on: DispatchQueue.main)&#10;            .sink(&#10;                receiveCompletion: { [weak self] completion in&#10;                    self?.isLoading = false&#10;                    if case .failure(let error) = completion {&#10;                        self?.errorMessage = error.localizedDescription&#10;                    }&#10;                },&#10;                receiveValue: { [weak self] user in&#10;                    self?.userName = user.name&#10;                    self?.userEmail = user.email&#10;                }&#10;            )&#10;            .store(in: &amp;cancellables)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Combine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Foundation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> User</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id: UUID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> email: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserServiceProtocol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: UUID) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AnyPublisher&#x3C;User, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">final</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProfileViewModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ObservableObject </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"l